    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but it feels a little too \"standard HR.\" I want it to sound a bit more personal and maybe use a metaphor to explain how his lateness disrupts the flow of the morning, so it doesn't just sound like a cold reprimand. Can you try a version that's a bit more descriptive about how the team feels when they're waiting on him to start?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
